  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Silver-tone stainless steel case and bracelet. Fixed silver-tone stainless steel bezel. Light green dial with silver-tone hands and index hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Luminescent hands and markers. Date display at the 3 o'clock position. ETA Caliber F06.115 quartz movement. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Solid case back. Tonneau case shape, case size: 40 mm, case thickness: 10.4 mm. Band width: 12 mm. Butterfly clasp with push buttons. Water resistant at 100 meters / 330 feet. Functions: date, hour, minute, second, battery eol indicator. Prx Series. Dress watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Tissot PRX Quartz Light Green Dial Men's Watch T137.410.11.091.01.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Tissot</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Prx</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">T137.410.11.091.01</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Movement</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #